A line graph (or column graph) with:
- $x$-axis: "Year of diagnosis" (2011–2015);
- $y$-axis: "Number of new cases of mesothelioma", with an even scale (e.g. 0–700);
- two lines/series, one for males and one for females, with all points plotted accurately;
- a key identifying males and females, and a title.
